  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Some nights, the plan changes and you're suddenly somewhere nicer than expected. Our Scarlett wallet handles that. It's crafted in suede with six card slots and an exterior slip pocket, on a chain strap that adjusts from crossbody to your shoulder depending on the venue. Looking under-prepared was never really our thing.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Suede</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 6 credit card slots, zip pocket, slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.2&quot; (L) x 4&quot; (H) x 1.20&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
